      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Immediate Update on Recent Baggage Handling Issue\n\nDear Valued Customers,\n\nWe want to sincerely express our heartfelt apologies for the inconvenience caused by the recent mishap at one of our hubs, resulting in passengers missing crucial flights or receiving unrelated baggage. We deeply regret the disturbance and frustration this issue may have caused.\n\nRest assured, we understand the critical importance of reliability and are taking all necessary steps to swiftly address and rectify the situation. We encourage those affected to continue monitoring their baggage information through our online tracking resources and to contact our dedicated customer support for further assistance or updates.\n\nThank you for your patience and understanding as we work diligently to resolve the situation and ensure such incidents don't happen again.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Company Name] Customer Relations Team",
